## Data Structure

- Integer array `id[]` of length `N`.
- Interpretation: `p` and `q` are connected if and only if they have the same `id`.

## Find

- Check if `p` and `q` have the

&lt;p class="line_hl">same id&lt;/p>.

## Union

- To merge components containing `p` and `q`, change all entries whose id equals `id[p]` to `id[q]`.
-->
&lt;hr></description></item><item><title>Quick-Union</title><link>https://wangy325.github.io/zh-cn/docs/snippets/algo/dynamic-connectivity/QuickUnion/</link><pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://wangy325.github.io/zh-cn/docs/snippets/algo/dynamic-connectivity/QuickUnion/</guid><description>&lt;!--
## Data Structure

- Integer array `id[]` of length ***N***.
- Interpretation: `id[i]` is parent of `i`. (树结构，索引为i的值指向其“父节点”的索引。)
- Root of `i` is `id[id[id[…id[i]…]]]`. (一直向上查找，直到`id[i] == i`，算法保证不会出现环。)

## Find

- Check if `p` and `q` have the same **root**.

## Union

- To merge components containing p and q, 

&lt;p class="line_hl">set the id of p’s root to the id of q’s root&lt;/p>.
-->
&lt;hr></description></item><item><title>Weighted Quick-Union</title><link>https://wangy325.github.io/zh-cn/docs/snippets/algo/dynamic-connectivity/WeightedQuickUnion/</link><pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://wangy325.github.io/zh-cn/docs/snippets/algo/dynamic-connectivity/WeightedQuickUnion/</guid><description>&lt;hr></description></item><item><title>Weighted Quick-Union with Path Compression</title><link>https://wangy325.github.io/zh-cn/docs/snippets/algo/dynamic-connectivity/WeightedQuickUnionWithPathCompression/</link><pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://wangy325.github.io/zh-cn/docs/snippets/algo/dynamic-connectivity/WeightedQuickUnionWithPathCompression/</guid><description>&lt;hr></description></item><item><title>Percolation(渗滤)</title><link>https://wangy325.github.io/zh-cn/docs/snippets/algo/dynamic-connectivity/Percolation/</link><pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://wangy325.github.io/zh-cn/docs/snippets/algo/dynamic-connectivity/Percolation/</guid><description>&lt;hr>
